B.3 Sample Efficient Robust Accuracy Estimation
We plot the variation of the absolute error with subset size for the approximation of the AutoAttack Robust Accuracy by the estimation of Algorithm 1. Results are presented in Fig. 10 and Fig. 11 for CIFAR10 and CIFAR100, respectively. From 100 samples, the approximation is already good for some models.
B.4 Pseudo-margin Learning Setup
The architecture and learning setup for the pseudo-margin is inspired from Corbière et al. (2019). A multilayer perceptron (Fig. 12) learns a pseudo-margin from the feature representations of the samples by minimizing the mean-squared error loss between the output pseudo-margin and an estimation of the input margin.
